438	     * shared {@link Region#acceptsPostcode(int) region-to-postcode} table ({@code NSW 2000-2099},
439	     * {@code VIC 3000-3099}, {@code QLD 4000-4099}). A city with no known region accepts any 4-digit
440	     * postcode. An out-of-range postcode is reported through an {@link InvalidOwnerPostcodeException},
441	     * which the {@code ExceptionControllerAdvice} renders as a 400 response.
442	     *
