698	    /**
699	     * Rejects a create request whose derived {@code identityKey} exactly equals an existing owner's.
700	     * The identity key consolidates the former separate telephone, email and household duplicate
701	     * checks into a single value: {@code normalizedTelephone + '|' + (email or empty) + '|' +
702	     * (householdId or empty)} (see {@link #identityKey(Owner)}). Because the telephone is part of the
703	     * key, two members of the same household (same {@code householdId}) with different telephones have
704	     * different identity keys and are both allowed; only an exact full-key match is a duplicate. A
705	     * collision is reported through a {@link DuplicateOwnerIdentityException}, which the
706	     * {@code ExceptionControllerAdvice} renders as a 409 Conflict response.
