817	     * Reports whether any existing owner already carries the given comparison {@code key}, derived
818	     * from each owner by {@code keyExtractor} (see {@link #findExistingOwner(Function, String)}).
819	     * The create endpoint's duplicate checks use this to reduce both an existing owner and the owner
820	     * being created to the same canonical key and reject a match.
